the target language is: prolog.

the predicates are:
    *a proposal* is on the agenda.
    *a proposal* is accepted.
    *a proposal* is rejected.

the knowledge base standoff includes:
    a proposal is accepted if
        the proposal is on the agenda
        and it is not the case that the proposal is rejected.

    a proposal is rejected if
        the proposal is on the agenda
        and it is not the case that the proposal is accepted.

scenario tabled is:
    the budget is on the agenda.

query outcome is:
    which proposal is accepted.
